# Toolchain packages whose name is identical on rpm, deb and arch.
# Provenance: Fedora 44 Everything repodata + Arch official repos +
# `apt-cache policy` on Ubuntu 26.04.1 all list these names verbatim.
# jupyter-notebook is here (NOT in a family file): the notebook package is
# called jupyter-notebook on every family -- archlinux.org's package search
# has no `jupyter` package at all, in any official repo or the AUR. Curation
# order is pinned by the fixture's exact-batch assert; family entries
# (packages.<family>.list) are prepended by lib/lists.sh.
nodejs
gcc
make
cmake
clang
jupyter-notebook